# Prefer Shared Subfolder for New Rules

Unless explicitly stated, whenever a rule is added to this repository, it should be placed in the appropriate `shared` subfolder (e.g., `.cursor/rules/always/shared`).

## Example
- If you add a new always-applied rule, place it in `.cursor/rules/always/shared` unless told otherwise.


